[gd_scene format=3]

; The Lode, under the Orrery (map offset (510.5, -192)): seams of molten glass gone cold in the core's rock. The seam from
; the Orrery drops into a flooded crack: sunk to its bottom (Ballast), a low gap leads out into a cavern of glowing seams,
; and a wall of cracked glass across it is bored (Drill). East, the door on to the Effigy. Back the same way, rising up
; the flooded crack to the Orrery.

